# 统一换行符为 LF，与 Prettier 的 endOfLine:lf 对齐，消除 Windows 下 CRLF 警告
* text=auto eol=lf

# 显式标记二进制资产，避免被当作文本规范化（内容改动换行无意义且易损坏）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.hdr binary
*.ktx2 binary
*.glb binary
*.basis binary
*.bin binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.gz binary
